# L §5.14.1: "A movement that reaches a running read, or a projection, of a place or a movement it doesn't declare
# ... is refused (LOAD-READS)": sweep reads bal(konto) with no reads line.
# Own reality: konto opens at 5 000.00 PLN, savings at 0; amt = 1 000.00 PLN, dom = 5.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source bank "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input bank_rows: observed
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move sweep[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto) - amt)

ask q: bal(savings, 2026-03-31)

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 1 000.00 PLN "own"
  dom = 5 "own"
  opening[konto] = 5 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-READS ...
